 not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [56, 2, 54]", 'District Ownership Code', 'The District Ownership Code (DOC) is the numeric code used to identify the category of the Administrative Authority. • 00 - County Office of Education • 02 – State Board of Education • 03 – Statewide ', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[56, 2, 54]'], 'schools.DOCType': [" The column is The District Ownership Code Type is the text description of the DOC category..  The values' format are (See text values in DOC field description above). The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Statewide Benefit Charter', 'Administration Only', 'County Office of Education (COE)']", 'The District Ownership Code Type is the text description of the DOC category.', '(See text values in DOC field description above)', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Statewide Benefit Charter', 'Administration Only', 'County Office of Education (COE)']"], 'schools.SOC': [" The column is The School Ownership Code is a numeric code used to identify the type of school..  The values' format are • 08 - Preschool • 09 – Special Education Schools (Public) • 11 – Youth Authority Facilities (CEA) • 13 – Opportunity Schools • 14 – Juvenile Court Schools • 15 – Other County or District Programs • 3. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [62, 65, 14]", 'The School Ownership Code is a numeric code used to identify the type of school.', '• 08 - Preschool • 09 – Special Education Schools (Public) • 11 – Youth Authority Facilities (CEA) • 13 – Opportunity Schools • 14 – Juvenile Court Schools • 15 – Other County or District Programs • 3', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[62, 65, 14]'], 'schools.SOCType': [" The column is The School Ownership Code Type is the text description of the type of school.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Junior High Schools (Public)', 'Youth Authority Facilities',