 / NumTstTakr. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [402, 27, 0]", 'Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500', 'Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500 commonsense evidence: Excellence Rate = NumGE1500 / NumTstTakr', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[402, 27, 0]'], 'schools.CDSCode': ['The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Unique. Values format like: [30103066028633, 38684786041453, 19647336116750]', '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Unique', '[30103066028633, 38684786041453, 19647336116750]'], 'schools.NCESDist': [' The column is This field represents the 7-digit National Center for Educational Statistics (NCES) school district identification number. The first 2 digits identify the state and the last 5 digits identify the scho. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [635090, 635310, 601324]', 'This field represents the 7-digit National Center for Educational Statistics (NCES) school district identification number. The first 2 digits identify the state and the last 5 digits identify the scho', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[635090, 635310, 601324]'], 'schools.NCESSchool': [' The column is This field represents the 5-digit NCES school identification number. The NCESSchool combined with the NCESDist form a unique 12-digit ID for each school.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [8643, 12388, 1330]', 'This field represents the 5-digit NCES school identification number. The NCESSchool combined with the NCESDist form a unique 12-digit ID for each school.', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[8643, 12388, 1330]'], 'schools.StatusType': [" The column is This field identifies the status of the district. .  The values' format are Definitions of the valid status types are listed below: · Active: The district is in operation and providing instructional servic