 records of closed or retired schools) may not have data in this f. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['2001 South Elm St.', '2100 Shell Beach Rd.', '2300 West Caldwell St']", 'The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location.', 'The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location. Note: Some records (primarily records of closed or retired schools) may not have data in this f', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['2001 South Elm St.', '2100 Shell Beach Rd.', '2300 West Caldwell St']"], 'schools.City': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Arleta', 'Loomis', 'Aguanga']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Arleta', 'Loomis', 'Aguanga']"], 'schools.Zip': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['91776-1791', '95035-4849', '92503-4925']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['91776-1791', '95035-4849', '92503-4925']"], 'schools.State': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: ['CA']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['CA']"], 'schools.MailStreet': [" The values' format are The unabbreviated mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: 1) Some entities (primarily closed or retired schools) may not have data in this field; 2) Many active ent. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['6420 Rustic Lane', '4215 East Gleason Street', '3276 Cortona Drive']", '', 'The unabbreviated mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: 1) Some entities (primarily closed or retired schools) may not have data in this field; 2) Many active ent', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['6420 Rustic Lane', '4215 East Gleason Street', '3276 Cortona Drive']"], 'schools.MailStrAbr': [" The 