 across three interconnected tables linked by school identification codes, enabling analysis at both the institutional and regional levels.\n\n#Tables Descriptions:  \n**frpm**: Contains data related to Free and Reduced-Price Meal (FRPM) eligibility for California schools, serving as a proxy for student socioeconomic status. Includes enrollment figures, counts of students eligible for free or FRPM meals, and corresponding percentages for K–12 and ages 5–17 groups. Also includes school-level identifiers such as CDS code, district and county names, charter status, grade range, and certification status from CALPADS. All records are from the 2014–2015 academic year.\n\n**satscores**: Provides SAT performance metrics for schools in California, including the number of test takers, average scores in Reading, Math, and Writing, and the count of students achieving total SAT scores of 1500 or higher. Linked to schools via CDS code, it also includes enrollment data for grades 1–12 and geographic identifiers such as county, district, and school name.\n\n**schools**: Offers detailed institutional and geographic information about California schools, including physical and mailing addresses, contact details, administrator names and emails, charter status, funding type, ownership codes (district and school level), educational options, instructional levels, grade spans offered and served, virtual instruction type, and coordinates (latitude and longitude). It also tracks operational status through open and close dates and was last updated in 2015.\n", 'db_col_dic': {'frpm.CDSCode': ['The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Unique. Values format like: [19647256057798, 37683386039978, 1612596001655]', '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Unique', '[19647256057798, 37683386039978, 1612596001655]'], 'frpm.`Academic Year`': ["The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: ['2014-2015']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['2014-2015']"], 'frpm.`County Code`': ['The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [25, 8, 16]', '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[25, 8, 16]'], 'frpm.`District Code`': ['The type is INTEGER, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [73940, 64964, 63271]', '', '', 'INTEGER', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[73940, 64964, 63271]'], 'frpm.`School Code`': ['The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [5730148, 6041917, 3030491]', '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[5730148, 6041917, 3030491]'], 'frpm.`County Name`': [" The column is County Code . The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Lake', 'Ventura', 'Siskiyou']", 'County Code ', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Lake', 'Ventura', 'Siskiyou']"], 'frpm.`District Name`': ["The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Oakley Union Elementary', 'San Lorenzo Valley Unified', 'Monterey Peninsula Unified']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Oakley Union Elementary', 'San Lorenzo Valley Unified', 'Monterey Peninsula Unified']"], 'frpm.`School Name`': ["The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Tassajara Hills Elementary', 'Oakdale Elementary', 'Ricardo Lizarraga Elementary']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Tassajara Hills Elementary', 'Oakdale Elementary', 'Ricardo Lizarraga Elementary']"], 'frpm.`District Type`': ["The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['High School District', 'Non-School Locations', 'Unified School District']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['High School District', 'Non-School Locations', 'Unified School District']"], 'frpm.`School Type`': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Preschool', 'District Community Day Schools', 'K-12 Schools (Public)']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Preschool', 'District Community Day Schools', 'K-12 Schools (Public)']"], 'frpm.`Educational Option Type`': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['County Community School', 'Opportunity School', 'Continuation School']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['County Community School', 'Opportunity School', 'Continuation School']"], 'frpm.`NSLP Provision Status`': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Provision 1', 'Breakfast Provision 2', 'Provision 2']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Provision 1', 'Breakfast Provision 2', 'Provision 2']"], 'frpm.`Charter School (Y/N)`': [" The values' format are 0: N; 1: Y. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: [1, 0]", '', '0: N; 1: Y', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[1, 0]'], 'frpm.`Charter School Number`': ['The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [1102, 1424, 1087]', '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[1102, 1424, 1087]'], 'frpm.`Charter Funding Type`': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Locally funded', 'Directly funded', 'Not in CS funding model']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Locally funded', 'Directly funded', 'Not in CS funding model']"], 'frpm.IRC': [" The values' format are Not useful. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: [1, 0]", '', 'Not useful', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[1, 0]'], 'frpm.`Low Grade`': ["The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [11, 7, 'Adult']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "[11, 7, 'Adult']"], 'frpm.`High Grade`': ["The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [9, 'K', 6]", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "[9, 'K', 6]"], 'frpm.`Enrollment (K-12)`': [" The values' format are commonsense evidence: K-12: 1st grade - 12nd grade . The type is REAL, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [2100, 191, 844]", '', 'commonsense evidence: K-12: 1st grade - 12nd grade ', 'REAL', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[2100, 191, 844]'], 'frpm.`Free Meal Count (K-12)`': [" The values' format are commonsense evidence: eligible free rate = Free Meal Count / Enrollment. The type is REAL, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [350, 137, 1239]", '', 'commonsense evidence: eligible free rate = Free Meal Count / Enrollment', 'REAL', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[350, 137, 1239]'], 'frpm.`Percent (%) Eligible Free (K-12)`': ['The type is REAL, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [0, 0, 0]', '', '', 'REAL', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[0, 0, 0]'], 'frpm.`FRPM Count (K-12)`': [" The column is Free or Reduced Price Meal Count (K-12).  The values' format are commonsense evidence: eligible FRPM rate = FRPM / Enrollment. The type is REAL, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [1631, 375, 861]", 'Free or Reduced Price Meal Count (K-12)', 'commonsense evidence: eligible FRPM rate = FRPM / Enrollment', 'REAL', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[1631, 375, 861]'], 'frpm.`Percent (%) Eligible FRPM (K-12)`': ['The type is REAL, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [0, 0, 0]', '', '', 'REAL', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[0, 0, 0]'], 'frpm.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)`': ['The type is REAL, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [870, 117, 505]', '', '', 'REAL', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[870, 117, 505]'], 'frpm.`Free Meal Count (Ages 5-17)`': [" The values' format are commonsense evidence: eligible free rate = Free Meal Count / Enrollment. The type is REAL, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [1187, 112, 956]", '', 'commonsense evidence: eligible free rate = Free Meal Count / Enrollment', 'REAL', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[1187, 112, 956]'], 'frpm.`Percent (%) Eligible Free (Ages 5-17)`': ['The type is REAL, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [0, 0, 0]', '', '', 'REAL', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[0, 0, 0]'], 'frpm.`FRPM Count (Ages 5-17)`': ['The type is REAL, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [356, 1236, 359]', '', '', 'REAL', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[356, 1236, 359]'], 'frpm.`Percent (%) Eligible FRPM (Ages 5-17)`': ['The type is REAL, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [0, 0, 0]', '', '', 'REAL', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[0, 0, 0]'], 'frpm.`2013-14 CALPADS Fall 1 Certification Status`': ['The type is INTEGER, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: [1]', '', '', 'INTEGER', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[1]'], 'satscores.cds': [' The column is California Department Schools. The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Unique. Values format like: [19647330124396, 30736433032109, 31668450121418]', 'California Department Schools', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Unique', '[19647330124396, 30736433032109, 31668450121418]'], 'satscores.rtype': [" The values' format are unuseful. The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: ['D', 'S']", '', 'unuseful', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['D', 'S']"], 'satscores.sname': [" The column is school name. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Vintage High', 'El Capitan High', 'La Canada High']", 'school name', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Vintage High', 'El Capitan High', 'La Canada High']"], 'satscores.dname': [" The column is district segment. The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Temple City Unified', 'Mendota Unified', 'Milpitas Unified']", 'district segment', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Temple City Unified', 'Mendota Unified', 'Milpitas Unified']"], 'satscores.cname': [" The column is county name. The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Lake', 'Santa Clara', 'Marin']", 'county name', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Lake', 'Santa Clara', 'Marin']"], 'satscores.enroll12': [' The column is enrollment (1st-12nd grade). The type is INTEGER, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [2471, 1607, 28]', 'enrollment (1st-12nd grade)', '', 'INTEGER', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[2471, 1607, 28]'], 'satscores.NumTstTakr': [" The column is Number of Test Takers in this school.  The values' format are number of test takers in each school. The type is INTEGER, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [101, 13, 457]", 'Number of Test Takers in this school', 'number of test takers in each school', 'INTEGER', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[101, 13, 457]'], 'satscores.AvgScrRead': [' The column is average scores in Reading. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [321, 467, 393]', 'average scores in Reading', '', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[321, 467, 393]'], 'satscores.AvgScrMath': [' The column is average scores in Math. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [328, 607, 589]', 'average scores in Math', '', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[328, 607, 589]'], 'satscores.AvgScrWrite': [' The column is average scores in writing. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [605, 413, 439]', 'average scores in writing', '', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[605, 413, 439]'], 'satscores.NumGE1500': [" The column is Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500.  The values' format are Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500 commonsense evidence: Excellence Rate = NumGE1500 / NumTstTakr. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [402, 27, 0]", 'Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500', 'Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500 commonsense evidence: Excellence Rate = NumGE1500 / NumTstTakr', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[402, 27, 0]'], 'schools.CDSCode': ['The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Unique. Values format like: [30103066028633, 38684786041453, 19647336116750]', '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Unique', '[30103066028633, 38684786041453, 19647336116750]'], 'schools.NCESDist': [' The column is This field represents the 7-digit National Center for Educational Statistics (NCES) school district identification number. The first 2 digits identify the state and the last 5 digits identify the scho. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [635090, 635310, 601324]', 'This field represents the 7-digit National Center for Educational Statistics (NCES) school district identification number. The first 2 digits identify the state and the last 5 digits identify the scho', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[635090, 635310, 601324]'], 'schools.NCESSchool': [' The column is This field represents the 5-digit NCES school identification number. The NCESSchool combined with the NCESDist form a unique 12-digit ID for each school.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [8643, 12388, 1330]', 'This field represents the 5-digit NCES school identification number. The NCESSchool combined with the NCESDist form a unique 12-digit ID for each school.', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[8643, 12388, 1330]'], 'schools.StatusType': [" The column is This field identifies the status of the district. .  The values' format are Definitions of the valid status types are listed below: · Active: The district is in operation and providing instructional services. · Closed: The district is not in operation and no longer providing . The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Pending', 'Merged', 'Active']", 'This field identifies the status of the district. ', 'Definitions of the valid status types are listed below: · Active: The district is in operation and providing instructional services. · Closed: The district is not in operation and no longer providing ', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Pending', 'Merged', 'Active']"], 'schools.County': [" The column is County name. The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Fresno', 'Merced', 'Madera']", 'County name', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Fresno', 'Merced', 'Madera']"], 'schools.District': ["The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Modoc-Tulelake Jt. Unified', 'Lemoore Union Elementary', 'Corning Union Elementary']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Modoc-Tulelake Jt. Unified', 'Lemoore Union Elementary', 'Corning Union Elementary']"], 'schools.School': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Devereux Severely Handicapped', 'Opportunity High', 'Coyote Creek Elementary']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Devereux Severely Handicapped', 'Opportunity High', 'Coyote Creek Elementary']"], 'schools.Street': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['1001 Brighton Avenue', '1281 Plumas Avenue', '1107 Lever Boulevard']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['1001 Brighton Avenue', '1281 Plumas Avenue', '1107 Lever Boulevard']"], 'schools.StreetAbr': [" The column is The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location..  The values' format are The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location. Note: Some records (primarily records of closed or retired schools) may not have data in this f. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['2001 South Elm St.', '2100 Shell Beach Rd.', '2300 West Caldwell St']", 'The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location.', 'The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location. Note: Some records (primarily records of closed or retired schools) may not have data in this f', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['2001 South Elm St.', '2100 Shell Beach Rd.', '2300 West Caldwell St']"], 'schools.City': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Arleta', 'Loomis', 'Aguanga']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Arleta', 'Loomis', 'Aguanga']"], 'schools.Zip': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['91776-1791', '95035-4849', '92503-4925']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['91776-1791', '95035-4849', '92503-4925']"], 'schools.State': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: ['CA']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['CA']"], 'schools.MailStreet': [" The values' format are The unabbreviated mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: 1) Some entities (primarily closed or retired schools) may not have data in this field; 2) Many active ent. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['6420 Rustic Lane', '4215 East Gleason Street', '3276 Cortona Drive']", '', 'The unabbreviated mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: 1) Some entities (primarily closed or retired schools) may not have data in this field; 2) Many active ent', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['6420 Rustic Lane', '4215 East Gleason Street', '3276 Cortona Drive']"], 'schools.MailStrAbr': [" The values' format are the abbreviated mailing street address of the school, district, or administrative authority.Note: Many active entities have not provided a mailing street address. For your convenience we have filled t. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['14935 Valerio St.', 'PO Box 687 PO Box 687', '6949 Genesee Ave.']", '', 'the abbreviated mailing street address of the school, district, or administrative authority.Note: Many active entities have not provided a mailing street address. For your convenience we have filled t', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['14935 Valerio St.', 'PO Box 687 PO Box 687', '6949 Genesee Ave.']"], 'schools.MailCity': [" The values' format are The city associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address city. For your convenience we have filled the. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Montebello', 'Whiskeytown', 'San Fracisco']", '', 'The city associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address city. For your convenience we have filled the', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Montebello', 'Whiskeytown', 'San Fracisco']"], 'schools.MailZip': [" The values' format are The zip code associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address zip code. For your convenience we have fi. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['96002-9210', '93024-0878', '90755-5858']", '', 'The zip code associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address zip code. For your convenience we have fi', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['96002-9210', '93024-0878', '90755