SQL_COMPONENT: 
```sql
SELECT 
    CDSCode,
    `School Name`,
    `Free Meal Count (K-12)`,
    `Enrollment (K-12)`,
    CAST(`Free Meal Count (K-12)` AS REAL) / `Enrollment (K-12)` AS eligible_free_rate
