emple City Unified', 'Mendota Unified', 'Milpitas Unified']"], 'satscores.cname': [" The column is county name. The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Lake', 'Santa Clara', 'Marin']", 'county name', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Lake', 'Santa Clara', 'Marin']"], 'satscores.enroll12': [' The column is enrollment (1st-12nd grade). The type is INTEGER, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [2471, 1607, 28]', 'enrollment (1st-12nd grade)', '', 'INTEGER', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[2471, 1607, 28]'], 'satscores.NumTstTakr': [" The column is Number of Test Takers in this school.  The values' format are number of test takers in each school. The type is INTEGER, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [101, 13, 457]", 'Number of Test Takers in this school', 'number of test takers in each school', 'INTEGER', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[101, 13, 457]'], 'satscores.AvgScrRead': [' The column is average scores in Reading. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [321, 467, 393]', 'average scores in Reading', '', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[321, 467, 393]'], 'satscores.AvgScrMath': [' The column is average scores in Math. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [328, 607, 589]', 'average scores in Math', '', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[328, 607, 589]'], 'satscores.AvgScrWrite': [' The column is average scores in writing. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [605, 413, 439]', 'average scores in writing', '', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[605, 413, 439]'], 'satscores.NumGE1500': [" The column is Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500.  The values' format are Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500 commonsense evidence: Excellence Rate = NumGE1500 / NumTstTakr. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [402, 27, 0]", 'Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500', 'Number of Test Takers Whose Total SAT Scores Are Greater or Equal to 1500 commonsense evidence: Excellence Rate = NumGE1500 / NumTstTakr', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[402, 27, 0]'], 'schools.CDSCode': ['The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Unique. Values format like: [30103066028633, 38684786041453, 19647336116750]', '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Unique', '[30103066028633, 38684786041453, 19647336116750]'], 'schools.NCESDist': [' The column is This field represents the 7-digit National Center for Educational Statistics (NCES) school district identification number. The first 2 digits identify the state and the last 5 digits identify the scho. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [635090, 635310, 601324]', 'This field represents the 7-digit National Center for Educational Statistics (NCES) school district identification number. The first 2 digits identify the state and the last 5 digits identify the scho', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[635090, 635310, 601324]'], 'schools.NCESSchool': [' The column is This field represents the 5-digit NCES school identification number. The NCESSchool combined with the NCESDist form a unique 12-digit ID for each school.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [8643, 12388, 1330]', 'This field represents the 5-digit NCES school identification number. The NCESSchool combined with the NCESDist form a unique 12-digit ID for each school.', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[8643, 12388, 1330]'], 'schools.StatusType': [" The column is This field identifies the status of the district. .  The values' format are Definitions of the valid status types are listed below: · Active: The district is in operation and providing instructional services. · Closed: The district is not in operation and no longer providing . The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Pending', 'Merged', 'Active']", 'This field identifies the status of the district. ', 'Definitions of the valid status types are listed below: · Active: The district is in operation and providing instructional services. · Closed: The district is not in operation and no longer providing ', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Pending', 'Merged', 'Active']"], 'schools.County': [" The column is County name. The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Fresno', 'Merced', 'Madera']", 'County name', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Fresno', 'Merced', 'Madera']"], 'schools.District': ["The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Modoc-Tulelake Jt. Unified', 'Lemoore Union Elementary', 'Corning Union Elementary']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Modoc-Tulelake Jt. Unified', 'Lemoore Union Elementary', 'Corning Union Elementary']"], 'schools.School': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Devereux Severely Handicapped', 'Opportunity High', 'Coyote Creek Elementary']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Devereux Severely Handicapped', 'Opportunity High', 'Coyote Creek Elementary']"], 'schools.Street': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['1001 Brighton Avenue', '1281 Plumas Avenue', '1107 Lever Boulevard']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['1001 Brighton Avenue', '1281 Plumas Avenue', '1107 Lever Boulevard']"], 'schools.StreetAbr': [" The column is The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location..  The values' format are The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location. Note: Some records (primarily records of closed or retired schools) may not have data in this f. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['2001 South Elm St.', '2100 Shell Beach Rd.', '2300 West Caldwell St']", 'The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location.', 'The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location. Note: Some records (primarily records of closed or retired schools) may not have data in this f', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['2001 South Elm St.', '2100 Shell Beach Rd.', '2300 West Caldwell St']"], 'schools.City': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Arleta', 'Loomis', 'Aguanga']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Arleta', 'Loomis', 'Aguanga']"], 'schools.Zip': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['91776-1791', '95035-4849', '92503-4925']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['91776-1791', '95035-4849', '92503-4925']"], 'schools.State': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: ['CA']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['CA']"], 'schools.MailStreet': [" The values' format are The unabbreviated mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: 1) Some entities (primarily closed or retired schools) may not have data in this field; 2) Many active ent. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['6420 Rustic Lane', '4215 East Gleason Street', '3276 Cortona Drive']", '', 'The unabbreviated mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: 1) Some entities (primarily closed or retired schools) may not have data in this field; 2) Many active ent', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['6420 Rustic Lane', '4215 East Gleason Street', '3276 Cortona Drive']"], 'schools.MailStrAbr': [" The values' format are the abbreviated mailing street address of the school, district, or administrative authority.Note: Many active entities have not provided a mailing street address. For your convenience we have filled t. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['14935 Valerio St.', 'PO Box 687 PO Box 687', '6949 Genesee Ave.']", '', 'the abbreviated mailing street address of the school, district, or administrative authority.Note: Many active entities have not provided a mailing street address. For your convenience we have filled t', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['14935 Valerio St.', 'PO Box 687 PO Box 687', '6949 Genesee Ave.']"], 'schools.MailCity': [" The values' format are The city associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address city. For your convenience we have filled the. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Montebello', 'Whiskeytown', 'San Fracisco']", '', 'The city associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address city. For your convenience we have filled the', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Montebello', 'Whiskeytown', 'San Fracisco']"], 'schools.MailZip': [" The values' format are The zip code associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address zip code. For your convenience we have fi. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['96002-9210', '93024-0878', '90755-5858']", '', 'The zip code associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address zip code. For your convenience we have fi', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['96002-9210', '93024-0878', '90755-5858']"], 'schools.MailState': [" The values' format are The state within the mailing address. For your convenience we have filled the unpopulated MailState cells with State data.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: ['CA']", '', 'The state within the mailing address. For your convenience we have filled the unpopulated MailState cells with State data.', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['CA']"], 'schools.Phone': ["The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['(530) 824-7715', '(714) 527-8821', '(619) 388-1234']", '', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['(530) 824-7715', '(714) 527-8821', '(619) 388-1234']"], 'schools.Ext': [' The column is The phone number extension of the school, district, or administrative authority.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [39117, 8110, 47499]', 'The phone number extension of the school, district, or administrative authority.', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[39117, 8110, 47499]'], 'schools.Website': [" The column is The website address of the school, district, or administrative authority.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['http://kordyak-rialto-ca.schoolloop.com/', 'www.fillmoreusd.org/', 'www.humboldt.k12.ca.us/hydesville_sd']", 'The website address of the school, district, or administrative authority.', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['http://kordyak-rialto-ca.schoolloop.com/', 'www.fillmoreusd.org/', 'www.humboldt.k12.ca.us/hydesville_sd']"], 'schools.OpenDate': [" The column is The date the school opened.. The type is DATE, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['1990-11-26', '1974-08-01', '2009-09-08']", 'The date the school opened.', '', 'DATE', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['1990-11-26', '1974-08-01', '2009-09-08']"], 'schools.ClosedDate': [" The column is The date the school closed.. The type is DATE, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['1990-05-07', '2003-06-06', '2011-08-02']", 'The date the school closed.', '', 'DATE', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['1990-05-07', '2003-06-06', '2011-08-02']"], 'schools.Charter': [" The column is This field identifies a charter school. .  The values' format are The field is coded as follows: · 1 = The school is a charter · 0 = The school is not a charter. The type is INTEGER, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: [1, 0]", 'This field identifies a charter school. ', 'The field is coded as follows: · 1 = The school is a charter · 0 = The school is not a charter', 'INTEGER', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[1, 0]'], 'schools.CharterNum': [" The column is The charter school number,.  The values' format are 4-digit number assigned to a charter school.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [1073, 928, 1254]", 'The charter school number,', '4-digit number assigned to a charter school.', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[1073, 928, 1254]'], 'schools.FundingType': [" The column is Indicates the charter school funding type.  The values' format are Values are as follows: · Not in CS (California School) funding model · Locally funded · Directly funded. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Not in CS funding model', 'Directly funded', 'Locally funded']", 'Indicates the charter school funding type', 'Values are as follows: · Not in CS (California School) funding model · Locally funded · Directly funded', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Not in CS funding model', 'Directly funded', 'Locally funded']"], 'schools.DOC': [" The column is District Ownership Code.  The values' format are The District Ownership Code (DOC) is the numeric code used to identify the category of the Administrative Authority. • 00 - County Office of Education • 02 – State Board of Education • 03 – Statewide . The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [56, 2, 54]", 'District Ownership Code', 'The District Ownership Code (DOC) is the numeric code used to identify the category of the Administrative Authority. • 00 - County Office of Education • 02 – State Board of Education • 03 – Statewide ', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', '[56, 2, 54]'], 'schools.DOCType': [" The column is The District Ownership Code Type is the text description of the DOC category..  The values' format are (See text values in DOC field description above). The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Statewide Benefit Charter', 'Administration Only', 'County Office of Education (COE)']", 'The District Ownership Code Type is the text description of the DOC category.', '(See text values in DOC field description above)', 'TEXT', 'Non-Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Statewide Benefit Charter', 'Administration Only', 'County Office of Education (COE)']"], 'schools.SOC': [" The column is The School Ownership Code is a numeric code used to identify the type of school..  The values' format are • 08 - Preschool • 09 – Special Education Schools (Public) • 11 – Youth Authority Facilities (CEA) • 13 – Opportunity Schools • 14 – Juvenile Court Schools • 15 – Other County or District Programs • 3. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [62, 65, 14]", 'The School Ownership Code is a numeric code used to identify the type of school.', '• 08 - Preschool • 09 – Special Education Schools (Public) • 11 – Youth Authority Facilities (CEA) • 13 – Opportunity Schools • 14 – Juvenile Court Schools • 15 – Other County or District Programs • 3', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', '[62, 65, 14]'], 'schools.SOCType': [" The column is The School Ownership Code Type is the text description of the type of school.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Junior High Schools (Public)', 'Youth Authority Facilities', 'Continuation High Schools']", 'The School Ownership Code Type is the text description of the type of school.', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Junior High Schools (Public)', 'Youth Authority Facilities', 'Continuation High Schools']"], 'schools.EdOpsCode': [" The column is The Education Option Code is a short text description of the type of education offered..  The values' format are  • ALTSOC – Alternative School of Choice • COMM – County Community School • COMMDAY – Community Day School • CON – Continuation School • JUV – Juvenile Court School • OPP – Opportunity School • YTH – . The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['TRAD', 'ALTSOC', 'SPEC']", 'The Education Option Code is a short text description of the type of education offered.', ' • ALTSOC – Alternative School of Choice • COMM – County Community School • COMMDAY – Community Day School • CON – Continuation School • JUV – Juvenile Court School • OPP – Opportunity School • YTH – ', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['TRAD', 'ALTSOC', 'SPEC']"], 'schools.EdOpsName': [" The column is Educational Option Name.  The values' format are The Educational Option Name is the long text description of the type of education being offered.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['County Community School', 'State Special School', 'Special Education School']", 'Educational Option Name', 'The Educational Option Name is the long text description of the type of education being offered.', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['County Community School', 'State Special School', 'Special Education School']"], 'schools.EILCode': [" The column is The Educational Instruction Level Code is a short text description of the institution's type relative to the grade range served..  The values' format are • A – Adult • ELEM – Elementary • ELEMHIGH – Elementary-High Combination • HS – High School • INTMIDJR – Intermediate/Middle/Junior High • PS – Preschool • UG – Ungraded. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['INTMIDJR', 'ELEMHIGH', 'A']", "The Educational Instruction Level Code is a short text description of the institution's type relative to the grade range served.", '• A – Adult • ELEM – Elementary • ELEMHIGH – Elementary-High Combination • HS – High School • INTMIDJR – Intermediate/Middle/Junior High • PS – Preschool • UG – Ungraded', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['INTMIDJR', 'ELEMHIGH', 'A']"], 'schools.EILName': [" The column is The Educational Instruction Level Name is the long text description of the institution’s type relative to the grade range served.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Elementary', 'Intermediate/Middle/Junior High', 'Preschool']", 'The Educational Instruction Level Name is the long text description of the institution’s type relative to the grade range served.', '', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['Elementary', 'Intermediate/Middle/Junior High', 'Preschool']"], 'schools.GSoffered': [" The column is The grade span offered is the lowest grade and the highest grade offered or supported by the school, district, or administrative authority. This field might differ from the grade span served as report.  The values' format are For example XYZ School might display the following data: GSoffered = P–Adult GSserved = K–12. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['3-6', '1-6', 4]", 'The grade span offered is the lowest grade and the highest grade offered or supported by the school, district, or administrative authority. This field might differ from the grade span served as report', 'For example XYZ School might display the following data: GSoffered = P–Adult GSserved = K–12', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['3-6', '1-6', 4]"], 'schools.GSserved': [" The column is It is the lowest grade and the highest grade of student enrollment as reported in the most recent certified CALPADS Fall 1 data collection. Only K–12 enrollment is reported through CALPADS. This field.  The values' format are commonsense evidence: 1. Only K–12 enrollment is reported through CALPADS 2. Note: Special programs at independent study, alternative education, and special education schools will often exceed the typ. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['K-12', 10, '7-11']", 'It is the lowest grade and the highest grade of student enrollment as reported in the most recent certified CALPADS Fall 1 data collection. Only K–12 enrollment is reported through CALPADS. This field', 'commonsense evidence: 1. Only K–12 enrollment is reported through CALPADS 2. Note: Special programs at independent study, alternative education, and special education schools will often exceed the typ', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['K-12', 10, '7-11']"], 'schools.Virtual': [" The column is This field identifies the type of virtual instruction offered by the school. Virtual instruction is instruction in which students and teachers are separated by time and/or location, and interaction oc.  The values' format are The field is coded as follows: · F = Exclusively Virtual – The school has no physical building where students meet with each other or with teachers, all instruction is virtual. · V = Primarily Virtual. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['N', 'F', 'P']", 'This field identifies the type of virtual instruction offered by the school. Virtual instruction is instruction in which students and teachers are separated by time and/or location, and interaction oc', 'The field is coded as follows: · F = Exclusively Virtual – The school has no physical building where students meet with each other or with teachers, all instruction is virtual. · V = Primarily Virtual', 'TEXT', 'Include Null', 'Non-Unique', "['N', 'F', 'P']"], 'schools.Magnet': [" The column is This field identifies whether a school