e 5-digit NCES school identification number. The NCESSchool combined with the NCESDist form a unique 12-digit ID for each school.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: [8643, 12388, 1330]\nStatusType:  The column is This field identifies the status of the district. .  The values' format are Definitions of the valid status types are listed below: · Active: The district is in operation and providing instructional services. · Closed: The district is not in operation and no longer providing . The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Pending', 'Merged', 'Active']\nCounty:  The column is County name. The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Fresno', 'Merced', 'Madera']\nDistrict: The type is TEXT, Which does not inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Modoc-Tulelake Jt. Unified', 'Lemoore Union Elementary', 'Corning Union Elementary']\nSchool: The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Devereux Severely Handicapped', 'Opportunity High', 'Coyote Creek Elementary']\nStreet: The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['1001 Brighton Avenue', '1281 Plumas Avenue', '1107 Lever Boulevard']\nStreetAbr:  The column is The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location..  The values' format are The abbreviated street address of the school, district, or administrative authority’s physical location. Note: Some records (primarily records of closed or retired schools) may not have data in this f. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['2001 South Elm St.', '2100 Shell Beach Rd.', '2300 West Caldwell St']\nCity: The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Arleta', 'Loomis', 'Aguanga']\nZip: The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['91776-1791', '95035-4849', '92503-4925']\nState: The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: ['CA']\nMailStreet:  The values' format are The unabbreviated mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: 1) Some entities (primarily closed or retired schools) may not have data in this field; 2) Many active ent. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['6420 Rustic Lane', '4215 East Gleason Street', '3276 Cortona Drive']\nMailStrAbr:  The values' format are the abbreviated mailing street address of the school, district, or administrative authority.Note: Many active entities have not provided a mailing street address. For your convenience we have filled t. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['14935 Valerio St.', 'PO Box 687 PO Box 687', '6949 Genesee Ave.']\nMailCity:  The values' format are The city associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address city. For your convenience we have filled the. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['Montebello', 'Whiskeytown', 'San Fracisco']\nMailZip:  The values' format are The zip code associated with the mailing address of the school, district, or administrative authority. Note: Many entities have not provided a mailing address zip code. For your convenience we have fi. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['96002-9210', '93024-0878', '90755-5858']\nMailState:  The values' format are The state within the mailing address. For your convenience we have filled the unpopulated MailState cells with State data.. The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Value of this column must in: ['CA']\nPhone: The type is TEXT, Which inlude Null and is Non-Unique. Values format like: ['(530) 824-7715', '(714) 527-8821', '(6